ia, serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:22px;text-align:left;c=
olor:#121212;">
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The US men=E2=80=99s national team returns=
 to action this week, and they=E2=80=99ll do so with a roster chock-full of=
 young stars. A total of 13 players without a senior national team cap coul=
d make their debuts in this coming window=E2=80=99s games against Peru, Chi=
le, Mexico and Canada, and most of them are teenagers who might not be on y=
our radar yet.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Well, they should be. I=E2=80=99ll have a =
fuller piece up on the Guardian later introducing you to the new kids on th=
e squad, but for now here are three of the more interesting players for you=
 to keep an eye on as the international break begins in earnest.</p>
<hr class=3D"dinkus" style=3D"border-color: #0077B6; border-width: 4px; bor=
der-style: solid; max-width: 280px; margin: 16px 0 10px;">
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 24px; line-height: 28px; padding=
-bottom: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Julian Hall</strong></p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;"><em><strong style=3D"color: #0077B6; font-=
style: normal; font-weight: 700;">Forward, Red Bull New York, 18 years old<=
/strong></em></p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">So unmissable was Hall=E2=80=99s early sea=
son form that the Polish federation presented Hall=E2=80=99s mother with a =
national team jersey bearing her maiden name, Zakrzewski. Hall, a dual citi=
zen, has yet to fully commit to either country, but Poland head coach Jan U=
rban will be closely counting Hall=E2=80=99s cap tally closely =E2=80=93 an=
 appearance in all four friendlies <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theg=
uardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRxN-FOKnwfkmH7-vx6hvS3_lEy4FY2KVQ=
W4rb_MhwYXtwzyN2iRskGydZevoIHPcwJlMYybAXdzCw26dSTlukp_9hcmUuRvBvvon2lJsYKM7=
n5V59YeLcfAVXYd04F5J2UHPtvivZqM6MgaelU2aPU6U-QTVvxSV7YuFzD6lwKHYs6KPh-9RR07=
3guC5HSEDnqRAMDNDWEQ6tXFDCkNYumni8QssXJagz8gNUrbxDqr0N2Zz28zCpDKz8GPttYmUeI=
gXZYMPVn_XmaZVYpfPmJo/4ub/57yUIryUTFy7MmQt0E7vaA/h10/h001._TxwWLzB110W-i8Wg=
2V1YmK5vAkdpRPINOkn6hF1LkM" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">could permanently tie=
 his future</a> to the United States. While his form dipped this summer alo=
ngside all of the Red Bulls, Hall=E2=80=99s call felt inevitable thanks to =
10 goals and five assists in 2,198 MLS minutes this season.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Thus far in his young career, Hall=E2=80=
=99s calling card has been his preternatural reading of space and knack for=
 slipping into scoring positions before opponents see it coming. While some=
 center forwards largely stay in the middle of the park and others drift in=
 from a half space to catch a goalkeeper off-center, Hall is happy to flow =
from sideline to sideline to get involved. From there, his interplay can ge=
t him into prime scoring territory: eight of his 10 goals this year have co=
me from shots inside the six-yard box.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Also of note: Hall was named in <a href=3D=
"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyT=
NtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEDom6Up7NBgS48fUZgZf5ceO-Bfvp-VHe3PDtb5mZUQQ_gUGUmakcZgtz=
Yg2t_dyACLETJWDfl7KPFtHnCw-gCmqsjaV1OMA6lyUYeRIon8OkDZAVFpLjoAOmTukfVkmjheq=
trk84u45Rh7Rp0X63njanhYzsL6lPDpvoIJk3mgxFMjfPpBvTGiUSGy9z4Z3WMVOqGw6OoBn5EX=
nRhLxrwsqVIvrz-SROnJCuLx_iRn82yP3Yah4VWFhU_4uq9_EX6Es6mgdDOHN2Fb7qpSWOg3lOV=
EviOXb2E64NrK52i-hme8AaGSoIOuy1IbIfcfPc6LW_cxjA7zA8wvmT4jnNJF/4ub/57yUIryUT=
Fy7MmQt0E7vaA/h11/h001.5zSUJyfNW5yCVEl9cFAjrgzKPoJm5iZcvh7udyNTmE0" style=
=3D"color: #0077B6;">last year=E2=80=99s Guardian Next Generation list</a> =
=E2=80=93 the next edition of that will be out soon.</p>
