<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Campbell first drew attention as part of G=
erman Bundesliga side Dortmund=E2=80=99s conveyor belt of dribbly American =
wingers. A summer move to recently promoted Elversberg has resulted in way =
more minutes on the field, with Campbell scoring his first Bundesliga goal =
last month in a win over Bayer Leverkusen. Fitting the Dortmund archetype, =
Campbell is a direct winger who looks to get past his defensive mark to fin=
d dangerous areas in and around the box.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Elversberg manager Vincent Wagner encourag=
es his charges to <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/=
u001.zFrJr-OAD6MUXPGxMNJG7OsncqtX0Ft8no7nT4tb8tSj8S6D62VyrnrkakoHTjYUEAfEJf=
zib9hS0Uxwm1Q81myuCiCMR3LsvR8UxiOcr-9x5cd-G2W7mnLNIrgNuPTsslWoOUkKVoRtJiDm7=
3gjMSdYywJfZVEPYnPFuY2sWo9b6gckmTtwGzzoLcMopnf1mlqE7VC87u1PhvpJTQ3_5L6-p3WK=
87vD2zAeYixQ9oIDdsPOk66yIIaUF6rfrfCF8XG1m-Xozn39Gb4m55iJI9PhSiH8NQds0yHuHYq=
Vora6I-EtJpIAE_tco7GhYR0RdF5YJjckBFIHen1h-xv_8Zt5wwem8rdKYZHLNSPFwI4/4ub/57=
yUIryUTFy7MmQt0E7vaA/h12/h001.11TUTenru5hlqfttyoNjnH0OmVdMgfqLib5gnWEdOyo" =
style=3D"color: #0077B6;">play without fear</a>, and the Houston native rev=
els in that mentality. In a small sample, Campbell has already shown plenty=
 of initiative to get on the ball in the final third, while looking more in=
clined to try his own shot than set up a teammate.</p>
<hr class=3D"dinkus" style=3D"border-color: #0077B6; border-width: 4px; bor=
